{"id":35,"date":"2026-03-16T13:52:18","date_gmt":"2026-03-16T13:52:18","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/?page_id=35"},"modified":"2026-03-23T11:35:22","modified_gmt":"2026-03-23T11:35:22","slug":"about-us","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/about-us\/","title":{"rendered":"About Us"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"alignleft size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"444\" height=\"133\" src=\"http:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/updated-logo-2023-for-firstdorm.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8\" srcset=\"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/updated-logo-2023-for-firstdorm.png 444w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/updated-logo-2023-for-firstdorm-300x90.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 444px) 100vw, 444px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><br>FirstDorm was founded to transform how 40 millions students in India live, learn and grow<\/h1>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"558\" src=\"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-1-EAST-FACING-1024x558.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-159\" srcset=\"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-1-EAST-FACING-1024x558.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-1-EAST-FACING-300x163.jpg 300w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-1-EAST-FACING-768x418.jpg 768w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-1-EAST-FACING-1536x837.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/COURTYARD-1-EAST-FACING-2048x1116.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">FirstDorm was founded to solve India&#8217;s student housing crisis \u2014 transforming how 40 million students live, learn, and grow. Our foundation is our proven real estate expertise and successful project execution<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>OUR STORY<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">India&#8217;s higher education system is the world&#8217;s largest \u2014 but its student housing has been left behind. Outdated hostels, under-funded infrastructure, and mismanaged facilities were the norm.<br><br>We saw an opportunity to change that.<br><br>Backed by 45+ years of real estate expertise and a team that has delivered over 70 million sq ft of living and learning spaces, FirstDorm was born with a simple mission: create world-class student accommodation that colleges can afford and students deserve.<br><br>Today, we partner with leading institutions across India\u2014investing, building, and managing residences that set new standards for student living.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\">A full-service Student Housing Developer &amp; Operator focused on India, we transform captive hostels into strategic institutional infrastructure by<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Investing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Designing &amp; Redesigning<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Building &amp; Redeveloping<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Furnishing &amp; Furbishing<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Operating &amp; Managing<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>PROMOTER TRACK RECORD<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">45+ Years<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Pan-India Real Estate Experience<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">13 million sq ft<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Living &amp; Working Spaces Delivered<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">$ 750 M<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Assets Managed<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\">Our leadership team and partners each bring 30+ years of expertise across real estate development, construction and engineering, asset management, facility management, food services, fund management, and consulting. We have designed and delivered educational infrastructure across top cities in India, and we bring that depth to every FirstDorm engagement.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>TEAM TRACK RECORD<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">40+ years Combined experience in:<br>\u2022 Real estate development<br>\u2022 Construction &amp; engineering<br>\u2022 Asset management<br>\u2022 Facility management<br>\u2022 Food services<br>\u2022 Fund management<br>\u2022 Management consulting<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">3 million sq ft<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Academic &amp; Residences Blocks in Campuses<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">70 million sq ft<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Living, Working, Learning Spaces Delivered<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"> 100 million sq ft<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Facilities Managed<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">10000 Meals a day<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Meals Served Daily<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>FirstDorm was founded to transform how 40 millions students in India live, learn and grow FirstDorm was founded to solve India&#8217;s student housing crisis 